      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Tecnologias:\n- Backend: FastAPI + SQLAlchemy + SQLite\n- Frontend: React 19 + Vite 6 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS 4\n- Package: pnpm (no npm!)\n- Deploy: Docker Compose (OMV NAS)\n- Backup: rclone -> Google Drive\n- Moneda: COP (pesos colombianos), iva 19%",
